<Prose title="About Sarees Hub" description="Sarees Hub puts saree shops, handloom weavers and wholesalers on one map so buyers can find them and talk to them directly." path="/about">
  <p>Every town in India has a saree shop people swear by, and every weaving cluster has looms making sarees you can't find online. Sarees Hub puts them all on one map.</p>
  <p>Buyers can search by fabric, weave, occasion or place — pure pattu in Dharmavaram, Kanchipuram silks in Chennai, ikat from Pochampally — see photos and prices, read reviews, and then call, WhatsApp or get directions to the seller. No middlemen and no commission.</p>
  <p>Sellers — from single-loom weavers to large showrooms — register for free. Every listing is checked by our team before it appears on the map.</p>
  <h2>Our promise</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Listing is free, forever. Paid plans only add visibility.</li>
    <li>Buyers deal with sellers directly. We never take a cut of your sale.</li>
    <li>Reviews come from signed-in Google accounts and are moderated for abuse.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/seller/register">Register your shop</a> or <a href="/map">explore the map</a>.</p>
</Prose>
